    [link] These 'Seven Stories About Tammy' add up to one brilliant piece of writing
    p: Elizabeth McCracken's connected short stories chronicle a family's encounters with their eldest son's girlfriend and eventual wife. This slim collection is so engaging, you may want to read it twice.
